            "\n"
            "TARGETS\n"
            "\n"
            "  host                a device that is also its own C64-side computer\n"
            "  cartridge@computer  a cartridge under test, in the computer that\n"
            "                      supplies its C64 keyboard and video\n"
            "\n"
            "An Ultimate II is a cartridge: it serves its own menu, memory and\n"
            "configuration, but has no keyboard of its own, so keys are injected\n"
            "into the computer it is plugged into and reach it over the expansion\n"
